          "input_ue_unconnectable": {}
        }
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "# 2ND SAMPLER\n\nbetween 0.7 and 0.9 denoise on the 2nd sampler (0.8 felt best most of the time)\n\nif you need prompt following better you need to bump up cfg above 1, but it can blow out and will take longer.\n\neuler/beta was recommended but seen different results with odd choices like  dpmpp_sde /ddim_uniform\n\n---\n\ngoogle search for best settings gave:\n\nSteps: 4–8 steps (8 is considered the maximum for best quality; 4-6 can work for faster iteration).\n\nCFG Scale: 1.0–2.0 (higher CFG, such as 3-4, may cause images to \"burn\" or become over-saturated, though some users prefer 2 for more contrast).\n\nSampler: euler or dpmpp_sde.\nScheduler: simple or beta.\n\nResolution: 1024x1024 is ideal for text rendering, though it handles resolutions up to 2048x2048.\n\nShift: Set the ModelSamplingAuraFlow to 7 (default is 3) for better quality."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
